 Yuri Butsa (Ukraine); Brian McCauley, Maria Longi (United States)."},{"alias":"S0007","ordinal":7,"page":0,"text":"Interim-Secretariat: Linda Van Gelder, Carolina Sanchez Paramo, Anthony Gaeta"},{"alias":"S0026","ordinal":26,"page":0,"text":"Item 5: Communications Strategy. The GC agreed that the Secretariat will provide a plan and timeline for developing and making operational a web page by December 6, and that it can proceed with implementation of the plan through Decision without a Meeting. GC members noted that they may wish to exchange views on any early public communications."},{"alias":"S0027","ordinal":27,"page":0,"text":"Item 6: Appointment of the Chair. The GC selected the United States representative Brian McCauley as Chair of the F.O.R.T.I.S. FIF Ukraine for a period of one year."},{"alias":"S0028","ordinal":28,"page":0,"text":"3"},{"alias":"S0029","ordinal":29,"page":0,"text":"Attachment:Agreed Agenda"},{"alias":"S0030","ordinal":30,"page":0,"text":"AGENDA for FIRST MEETING Governing Committee (GC) of the Facilitation of Resources to Invest in Strengthening Ukraine Financial Intermediary Fund (F.O.R.T.I.S. Ukraine FIF)"},{"alias":"S0031","ordinal":31,"page":0,"text":"Agenda Items"},{"alias":"S0032","ordinal":32,"page":0,"text":"1. Document Approval. Does the GC approve the (i) Governance Framework; (ii) Operations Manual; (iii) Standard Provisions of the Contribution Arrangement; (iv) Financial Procedures Agreement; and (iv) Funding Request Template."},{"alias":"S0033","ordinal":33,"page":0,"text":"2. Operating Context. The Government of Ukraine will take the floor to provide a general overview of the current operating context in Ukraine and Ukraine’s most pressing needs."},{"alias":"S0034","ordinal":34,"page":0,"text":"3. Strategic Directions. Does the GC agree that in setting strategic directions, this should include a discussion of Ukraine’s anticipated financing and recovery needs over the next three years, with a primary focus on the next 12 months, and how the FIF can best address those needs. The Government of Ukraine will submit a short Strategic Directions Note to the GC for comment and the Strategic Directions will be agreed by the GC prior to first disbursement."},{"alias":"S0035","ordinal":35,"page":0,"text":"4. Work Plan, Budget, and Fees. Does the GC agree that the work plan and budget for the Secretariat and Trustee should be submitted by December 6, and that its approval can be made through Decision without a Meeting by December 13? Does the GC agree that the Secretariat should provide a short note on the agreements reached around fees by December 6, and that its approval can be made through Decision without a Meeting by December 13"}],"toPlace":["S0001","S0003","S0030","S0031"],"protocolErrors":[]}","response":"{
